@SBF_FTX @BidenPepe @cz_binance It looks like the matching engine of FTX is batch exciting the orders received in a certain period, while Binance or other exchanges match them one by one. 

User1 will get filled first on Binance or OKX in the same senerio.

Why is this unfair for small traders? ↓

@quant_arb @SBF_FTX @BidenPepe @cz_binance A small player sends only 1 order, and it took 40-150ms to be matched.

A big player floods 10 orders, some orders might be matched in 40ms, and some may match in 150ms. The probability of some orders be filled quickly will be higher.

On both rest and FIX api

